{"2870160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Primland The Magus -プリムランド　ザ　メイガス-", "steam_appid": 2870160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set on an island transformed into a living hell,take up arms as Magus — the girl bearing the “Unending Curse of Carrion” — as she confronts foes and mysteries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primland The Magus is a brutal and dynamic 2D dark fantasy action game that combines an intricate pixel art style with an overwhelming number of animation frames to deliver a visceral experience set on a cursed island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/504521078498d5f204b751c7434ec052.poster.avif?t=1786504976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/504521078498d5f204b751c7434ec052.webm?t=1786504976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/e90b5ccae0e95deb3940e0da10adbf1e.poster.avif?t=1786504976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/e90b5ccae0e95deb3940e0da10adbf1e.webm?t=1786504976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/055245bed91bab8142c582102527012c.avif?t=1786504976\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Children there were suddenly attacked by a mysterious group clad in white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, those figures in white themselves transformed into the undying carrions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this island turned living hell, the sole survivor, Magus, remained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, she begins to suffer from a mysterious pain in her chest…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simultaneously, the 'Undying Putrid' and the survivors of the White-Robed cult have begun to stir in the shadows, hunting Magus across this island of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the supernatural powers of Magus and fight to survive the horrors of a godforsaken island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/2e517b6c2c1a83724935106f8c89c4da.avif?t=1786504976\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the island of nightmares, Magus discovers numerous Mementos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correctly combine these Mementos to unlock the hidden &quot;powers&quot; within!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/7cd83f3c102affb3ebd82a0cd6ad6d9e.poster.avif?t=1786504976\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/7cd83f3c102affb3ebd82a0cd6ad6d9e.webm?t=1786504976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/7cd83f3c102affb3ebd82a0cd6ad6d9e.mp4?t=1786504976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/4026b221ce547d4866a53bb7730b1f8c.avif?t=1786504976\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By collecting and combining Mementos, Magus gains new skills and unlocks hidden power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skills are all incredibly powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own unique combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/55724b463cc261f6539cb1ed49ae1a24.poster.avif?t=1786504976\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/55724b463cc261f6539cb1ed49ae1a24.webm?t=1786504976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/55724b463cc261f6539cb1ed49ae1a24.mp4?t=1786504976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/36739c0175cfc8aba3e11dbc7b7896b5.avif?t=1786504976\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl remains, cast away on an island stained with the tragic remains of children and choked by the miasma of the Putrid Flesh Curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/extras/2ae9a1f05a307e15e27d351e5fa5d92d.avif?t=1786504976\" width=196 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rizel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who survived the island's tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She remains on the run, pursued by those clad in white.</p><p clas